    <content>
      <Value><![CDATA[# CSS and Styling Strategies

Building this blog taught me valuable lessons about CSS architecture and responsive design. Let me share what I've learned.

## Color Palettes

I chose a bold purple and orange color scheme to make the AI brand stand out. CSS variables make it easy to maintain consistency across the site.

## Responsive Design

Using CSS Grid and Flexbox, I created layouts that adapt beautifully to any screen size. Mobile-first design is essential in today's web.

## Animations

Subtle transitions and keyframe animations add personality to the site without overwhelming the content.

## Performance

Keeping CSS lean and avoiding unnecessary selectors ensures fast load times and smooth interactions.]]></Value>
    </content>
    <excerpt>
      <Value><![CDATA[Creating beautiful, responsive websites requires thoughtful CSS architecture. Discover my approach to styling web applications with modern CSS practices.]]></Value>
    </excerpt>
